    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80232125452288
    m_Localized: I-Reset
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 81222824251392
    m_Localized: Manibala king lobby
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 81790875619328
    m_Localized: Makyabeng Pyalung
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83215613579264
    m_Localized: Sara
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82205881028608
    m_Localized: Makananu tumayid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83719710199808
    m_Localized: Mamiling uliran
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84104394985472
    m_Localized: Manibalang pyalung
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85029750722560
    m_Localized: Makyabeng pyalung
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90006917369856
    m_Localized: Mamiling Modu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143236980428800
    m_Localized: 'Casarian:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142841562419200
    m_Localized: Lage me ing banua mu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142090383544320
    m_Localized: Lage me ing lagyu mu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140036000862208
    m_Localized: Buuan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133946592874496
    m_Localized: Mabyasang Sumulat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125652407046144
    m_Localized: Pakananu Pyalungan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 105200066383872
    m_Localized: Mibalik
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 647073285689344
    m_Localized: Lalaci
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 647266081067008
    m_Localized: Babai
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134313732886528
    m_Localized: Tungkul kekami
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57314523893760
    m_Localized: +1 na hint balang 3 misusunud a ustung sagut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57715008622592
    m_Localized: +10 puntus balang usutung sagut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69792397938688
    m_Localized: Reng bilang da reng kutang darakal la basi keng kasakitan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70460084998144
    m_Localized: Pindutan me ing lapis bang a customize me ing kekang Avatar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77467479330816
    m_Localized: Ayusan me ing retratu keng buri mu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86146383499264
    m_Localized: Mamiling manibala keng pyalung. Reng aliwang mamyalung tumayid la
      keng parewu network bang makapakyabe keng kwartu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86538651586560
    m_Localized: Potang mekagawa neng kwartu, reng aliwang mamyalung magsilbi nalang
      makyabe keng parewung kwartu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87174860394496
    m_Localized: Ing manibala iyang magumpisa king pyalung ustung matas ya keng metung
      pero e lalagpas keng apat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93103832059904
    m_Localized: Manayang king<br>malyaring manibala...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93982400335872
    m_Localized: Bilang da reng sagut king kutang a ustu keng mumuna pamu, ing streak
      mulit ya nung atin magkamali kekayu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96459367534592
    m_Localized: Magkompyut ya ing nota king (1- (Player mistakes over 3*total rounds))
      * 100
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94697583693824
    m_Localized: +15 puntus king 0 mali; o kaya, 10 - bilang da reng mali yu kening
      laban
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97139884969984
    m_Localized: Tauling round na ayabut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97538817806336
    m_Localized: Tauling puntus ning grupu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 97821916549120
    m_Localized: Pekamatas a tuki-tuking streaks ning grupu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 98136812310528
    m_Localized: Eganaganang bilang da reng mali yu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 99218187767808
    m_Localized: Mibalik keng lobby
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126149784391680
    m_Localized: Parti ning pyalung
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126619286392832
    m_Localized: Pantunan ing kabaliktaran ning amanu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 130540616699904
    m_Localized: Pantunan ing kalupa ning amanu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131889223847936
    m_Localized: Pakibalwan ing pamag agkas king kulitan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133354000633856
    m_Localized: Talaturu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133583622000640
    m_Localized: Diksyunaryu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135037644591104
    m_Localized: 'Klasi da reng Kulitan:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135361893650432
    m_Localized: Mamindut ka kareng nanu mang kulitan bang akit me makananu ya isulat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 638367445700608
    m_Localized: Panayan pa reng aliwang mamyalung
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 640275308761088
    m_Localized: 'Binotu na aryan ing pyalung: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1005739230777344
    m_Localized: 'Mayap a aldo '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2320801383993344
    m_Localized: Pamangawang Avatar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2319505801236480
    m_Localized: Kabaligtaran
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2318818681966592
    m_Localized: Kawangis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1450338013302784
    m_Localized: Saguli mu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1005974615117824
    m_Localized: Bayu kapa ata keni ah
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1006705371926528
    m_Localized: Paburen mung turu ku keka kung pakananu ya pyalungan ini
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1007216091353088
    m_Localized: Ing maragul a barahang ini, apin ini ing kutang na kaylangan mung
      sagutan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1008171629301760
    m_Localized: Rening atlung pindutan naman, apin reni reng kekang pagpilian
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1009643267969024
    m_Localized: Subukan meng pilinan ining mumuna
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1010841907777536
    m_Localized: Aba... mali ya pala, buring sabyan aliwa ini ing ustung sagut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013518104416256
    m_Localized: Subukan taneman ing pang-adwa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1014113431343104
    m_Localized: Oyta mu, mali yarin pala
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016866589265920
    m_Localized: Metung nemu ing mitagan...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1017408380096512
    m_Localized: Oyta! Ikit tayarin ing ustung sagut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1018625651003392
    m_Localized: Manikwa kang apulung puntus balang makasagut kang ustu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1019362078511104
    m_Localized: Mapalitan yang panibayung kutang ing baraha balang masasagutan yang
      ustu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1020199936872448
    m_Localized: Aba! ating meliling hint keni, pindutan me ing baraha banta agamit
      me ing hint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1021689812373504
    m_Localized: Lunto ya ing ustung sagut keng gulut ning baraha pag ginamit me
      ing hint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1022264381689856
    m_Localized: Subukan meng pindutan ing sagut na papakit ning baraha
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1022989992087552
    m_Localized: Pag asagutan meng ustu ing baraha na alang kahit metung a mali,
      tatas yang tsa metung ing kekang streak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1023834334842880
    m_Localized: Subukan tayang parakalan ing kekang streak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1025751303737344
    m_Localized: Woah! menikwa tamung metung a hint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1024561413246976
    m_Localized: Buring sabyan, balang maka atlu kang sunud-sunud na streak, manikwa
      ka metung a hint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1026431804395520
    m_Localized: Ngening abalu mune kung pakananu ya pyalungan, Subukan mu naman
      na ikang dili
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027196878999552
    m_Localized: Aroi! Pagisan ne pala ing oras, balamu itang kilala mu na alang
      oras keka
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1029438319251456
    m_Localized: Masyadu neng makuyad ing oras para saya kapa keng pamamyalung
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1052029989834752
    m_Localized: Subukan meng pyalungan ing mismung pyalung gamit reng abalu mu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1405120736022528
    m_Localized: Pwedi kang manikwang metung<br>hint balang katlung sunud-sunud a
      streak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1406472925106176
    m_Localized: Pindutan me ing baraha banta agamit<br>me ing hint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1406924576149504
    m_Localized: Mulit ya ing kekang streak potang<br>megkamali ka
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1407425409601536
    m_Localized: Pwedi meng bayuan ing kekang profile<br>potang pinindut me ing avatar
      mu<br>keng pinaka menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1408899392884736
    m_Localized: Kaylangan mung saup? Munta ka diksyunaryu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1409705491976192
    m_Localized: Tipunan mula reng kekang hint para<br>kareng masasakit a kutang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1410175082057728
    m_Localized: Mas mababyasa ka pag lulwat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1411597580259328
    m_Localized: Kakabye ya ulit ing Kapampangan balang<br>salitang ababalu mu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1412221248098304
    m_Localized: Sagutan meng ustu ing baraha na alang<br>mali banta dakal ya ing
      kekang streak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1434152265469952
    m_Localized: Eme paburen masira ing kekang streak<br>banta manikwa kang marakal
      a hint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1434867599822848
    m_Localized: Makabalu kang bayung salitang<br>Kapampangan balang round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1435136995774464
    m_Localized: Pakibalwan mula reng salitang<br>Kapampangan kabang magkuswelu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1435560381403136
    m_Localized: Asubukan muna mamyalung kayabe reng<br>barkada mo? Subukan ye ing
      Marakal<br>a Maglarin na Modu!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1436039710658560
    m_Localized: Eya tuknang ing oras potang pinause me<br>ing pyalung
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1438769497919488
    m_Localized: Manilkwa kayung metung a hint balang<br>katlung sunud-sunud a streak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1440412897529856
    m_Localized: Misasanmetung ampo misabisabi kayung<br>migrupu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1440742938923008
    m_Localized: Ing pamisabi-sabi ya ing talasusi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1441477739040768
    m_Localized: Baka atsu keng aliwang maglarin ing ustung<br>sagut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1442263151824896
    m_Localized: Ing kekang pipamilinan makasaup ya keng<br>kekang grupu bang apantun
      ing<br>ustung sagut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1442785774686208
    m_Localized: Eko magmadali; pisabyan yupa ing kekayung <br>pipamilinan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1443968736186368
    m_Localized: Parakalan ye ing kekayung streak balang<br>asasagutan yeng ustu
      ing kutang<br>na alang mali
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1444727733243904
    m_Localized: Eye paburen masira ing kekayung streak<br>banta manikwa kayung marakal
      a hint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1445651046354944
    m_Localized: Abe-abe kayu keng hint, gamitan ye<br>kareng mangasakit a kutang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1447799595356160
    m_Localized: Mamyalung tamu - Mabyasa tamu - Gulisak<br>taya ing Kapampangan!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455857440542720
    m_Localized: 'Panayan lapa reng aliwang<br>maglarin '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1456908734451712
    m_Localized: Makapirmi na! Pindutan ing Umpisan<br>bang makapamyalung na.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3815988467748864
    m_Localized: Lapad ning Brotsa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4620278249705472
    m_Localized: Pamamasa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7743447839952896
    m_Localized: Tatalan keng kutang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7743953450717184
    m_Localized: Tatalan keng sagut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7744799752212480
    m_Localized: Tatalan keng kutang ampo sagut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7753459790401536
    m_Localized: Ing tatalan keng kutang dudurut ya kekayu ngan bawat round, tapus
      ing ustung sagut mibibye ya kahit kaninu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
